# OpenBot on this host — speak to agents

Runbook: `docs/OPENBOT_NODE_MESH.md` · Download: https://openbot.run/

Replace `HOSTNAME` with MagicDNS name (macbook-pro, msi-gpu, dark-factory, …).

## Install

- [ ] Install OpenBot (macOS / Windows / Linux AppImage) on **this** machine
- [ ] Provider connected (Claude / Codex / Cursor — one minimum)
- [ ] OmniRoute on localhost:20128; `OLLAMA_HOST` if GPU — `llm-mesh-preflight.sh` PASS
- [ ] OpenBot model/base URL → `http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1` when using local route

## Agents (this node)

- [ ] Create 2–4 named agents (roles match hostname — factory agents only on Dark Factory)
- [ ] Test handoff: Agent A → Agent B one task line from vault
- [ ] Phone OpenBot app points at **this** desktop tailnet name (optional)

## With Herdr (same box)

- [ ] `herdr` running; separate workspace or pane for `claude`/`hermes`
- [ ] OpenBot for exploratory chat; Obsidian **▶ next step** for committed checklists
- [ ] No duplicate secrets — providers auth in OpenBot/OmniRoute UI only

## Hostname

- [ ] `HOSTNAME=____________` · `STUDEX_ROLE` in `lab-mesh.env`